cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata provided in this file."

title: "Reset Control Toolbox"
type: software
version: 1.0.0

authors:
  - family-names: "Hosseini"
    given-names: "Ali"
    affiliation: "Delft University of Technology"

abstract: >
  MATLAB implementations of analysis and design tools for reset control
  systems, including CgLp design, higher-order sinusoidal-input describing
  functions (HOSIDFs), closed-loop pseudo-sensitivity, frequency-domain
  stability assessment, nonlinearity quantification, reliability metrics,
  and shaping-filter design.

license: BSD-3-Clause

repository-code: "https://github.com/AliHosseini44/reset-control-toolbox"

keywords:
  - reset control
  - nonlinear control
  - CgLp
  - HOSIDF
  - pseudo-sensitivity
  - robust control
  - shaping filter
  - MATLAB
